WEBVTT

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:02.280
Who are you?

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:05.240
Love's trump card,

00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:09.590
Cure Ace!

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:18.200
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.680
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:23.550
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:25.590
Every day it sparkles

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:29.290
Dokidoki Precure

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:36.160
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:41.810
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:47.460
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:52.910
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:58.600
If your friends are in trouble

00:00:58.810 --> 00:01:07.470
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:09.150
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:11.570
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.400
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:17.200
What's more than just cute

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:21.080
is our promise between girls

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:27.120
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:33.020
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:45.020
Recover Your Love!

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:45.020
Recover Your Love!

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:48.990
Cure... Ace?

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.090
I've never seen her before!

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:56.040
<i>Who is she?</i>

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:58.950
<i>Just looking at her makes me sick to my stomach!</i>

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:03.200
Get out of my sight!

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:10.410
Just where were you aiming?

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:27.890
She's fast!

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:31.370
I shall end this fight in one blow!

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.120
Beautify! {彩る - to color, or to apply makeup. I can't think of anything that really fits well without sounding awkward, so I'll go with this, the main goal of applying makeup.}{I actually hate this a lot less after hearing the "Beauty makes right" bit of her full transformation, since she clearly places beauty above all else.}

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:52.310
Love Kiss Rouge!

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:03.410
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:05.000
Ace Shot!

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:06.130
Bang!

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:20.380
Regina!

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.280
Regina!

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:30.730
Regina!

00:03:32.540 --> 00:03:34.750
Cure Ace, was it?

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:35.760
I'll remember that name.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:39.470
Wait, don't take Regina away!

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:44.400
Regina...

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.390
Precures...

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.850
I'll <i>never</i> forgive you! {I know, anime English, but this wording stings more in light of Mana's pursuit of friendship with Regina. Moreso than an "I'll make you pay!" would, anyway.}

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:55.050
Precures!

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:56.910
Regina!

00:03:58.930 --> 00:03:59.970
Mana!

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:13.740
Do you think your tears will bring her back?

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:16.450
Now stand.

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:20.000
You have no time to waste.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.910
Now hold on!

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:26.600
You don't know how strongly Mana felt for Regina!

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:28.480
I may not know who you are or where you came from,

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:32.460
but I will not allow someone to disrespect Mana's feelings!

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:35.190
The Precure's Five Vows!

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:37.100
First!

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:41.520
A Precure must always hold her head high and persevere!

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.870
Now, gather your strength.

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:47.740
I can't...

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:52.010
That was all the strength I had!

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.180
You leave me no choice.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:04.620
Until you recover your love,

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:06.320
I shall take hold of this.

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:09.340
A fair deal, no?

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:11.160
Adieu.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.120
W-Wait!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:16.520
She left...

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:18.440
I'm sorry, girls...

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:21.150
She was completely right...

00:05:21.150 --> 00:05:24.170
I don't deserve to be a Precure!

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:25.760
Mana...

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:27.750
Mana, it's not your fault!

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:31.000
So please, don't cry!

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:45.270
Oh, poor daughter of mine,

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:46.900
slumber for now.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:50.040
Deeply... ever so deeply.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:55.610
And who was that Cure Ace?

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:57.310
We do not know.

00:05:57.310 --> 00:05:59.710
But she is a fierce opponent.

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:04.790
Seems she's a bit too much for you to handle, Belly.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:07.880
I told you never to call me that, Leva! {If we're going by the Seven Princes of Hell naming conventions, this is probably closest to Leviathan.}

00:06:08.160 --> 00:06:13.850
You mean to tell me that you lot have yet to conquer a single world?

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:18.540
We've already led three worlds to their doom!

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:20.580
Gula! {"Gula" being Latin for "gluttony." For some reason, I had always thought Bel was short for Beelzebub, but I guess it must refer to Belphegor. I don't study this shit enough.}

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:24.870
Doesn't mean much when all three of 'em were ape-infested boonies.

00:06:25.260 --> 00:06:27.080
My, you've got quite the mouth!

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:29.490
How about I gobble you up head first?

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.140
Go ahead and try, fatso!

00:06:31.560 --> 00:06:33.610
Cease your foolishness!

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:38.570
Leva, and Gula as well,

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:42.920
I task you with the annihilation of the Precures!

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:44.120
Yes sir!

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:49.050
O{*\fax-0.189}o{*\fax-0.177}g{*\fax-0.166}a{*\fax-0.155}i {*\fax-0.132}S{*\fax-0.121}h{*\fax-0.11}o{*\fax-0.098}p{*\fax-0.087}p{*\fax-0.076}i{*\fax-0.065}n{*\fax-0.053}g {*\fax-0.031}D{*\fax-0.019}i{*\fax-0.008}s{*\fax0.003}t{*\fax0.015}r{*\fax0.026}i{*\fax0.037}c{*\fax0.048}t {*\fax0.071}F{*\fax0.082}e{*\fax0.094}s{*\fax0.105}t{*\fax0.116}i{*\fax0.127}v{*\fax0.139}al

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:49.050
O{*\fax-0.189}o{*\fax-0.177}g{*\fax-0.166}a{*\fax-0.155}i {*\fax-0.132}S{*\fax-0.121}h{*\fax-0.11}o{*\fax-0.098}p{*\fax-0.087}p{*\fax-0.076}i{*\fax-0.065}n{*\fax-0.053}g {*\fax-0.031}D{*\fax-0.019}i{*\fax-0.008}s{*\fax0.003}t{*\fax0.015}r{*\fax0.026}i{*\fax0.037}c{*\fax0.048}t {*\fax0.071}F{*\fax0.082}e{*\fax0.094}s{*\fax0.105}t{*\fax0.116}i{*\fax0.127}v{*\fax0.139}al

00:06:54.960 --> 00:07:01.640
Frankfurters

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.200
Hello!

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:58.280
Welcome!

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:00.480
Ooh, that smells good!

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:01.640
Want a taste?

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:03.260
Don't mind if we do.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:06.110
Um, about Mana...

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:09.540
She hasn't left her room since yesterday. {She says "sleep," but it's be too clunky to keep that part in. The important part is that Mana went hikki, anyway.}

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:11.520
She didn't eat breakfast, either. {She only mentions breakfast, and since there's only been one morning between then and now, I assume it's a singular one.}

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.210
I see...

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:15.500
Did something happen?

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:16.360
Huh?

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:17.390
What kind of something?

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:21.480
I've never seen Mana be so down in the dumps.

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:25.190
I thought that maybe she got into a spat with Regina.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:29.090
Well, it wasn't what I'd call a spat...

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:32.990
Don't worry.

00:07:32.990 --> 00:07:35.330
She may be in pain right now,

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.780
but Mana will be back on her feet soon enough.

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:41.490
You're right.

00:07:41.490 --> 00:07:44.480
Mana's got some good friends, huh?

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:51.580
It seems Mana's depressed.

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.400
I can't blame her.

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.290
Not only did Regina get taken away...

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.620
But her Lovies was confiscated, too.

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:02.120
Just who was that Cure Ace?

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.390
About that...

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:07.950
We have been searching for Cure Ace's location,

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:10.700
but we have yet to retrieve any useful data.

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:14.330
She's as stubborn as she is strong!

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:14.920
Hmm?

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.010
Mana's grandfather?

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.500
Hello!

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:23.760
Oh, hello.

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:26.270
What are those boxes for?

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:29.820
I'm runnin' a garage sale at the festival.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.730
Mana said she'd help, but...

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:37.230
We can help, if you'd like.

00:08:37.230 --> 00:08:38.380
You sure?

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:39.980
Why, absolutely!

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:40.880
Um...

00:08:42.140 --> 00:08:44.010
I'll help too!

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:53.180
Welcome!

00:08:55.290 --> 00:08:57.240
Makopi, I'd like this!

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:58.290
100 yen!

00:08:58.290 --> 00:08:59.620
I'm a huge fan!

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.130
Keep doing your thing!

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:03.130
Thank you very much!

00:09:05.030 --> 00:09:07.140
Weren't we running a garage sale?

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:09.520
Being busy is hardly a bad thing.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:13.100
Yeah, it gets lively when people get together.

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:15.840
And lively towns mean happy people.

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:20.230
Let us liven up this festival in Mana's stead.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:21.970
Sounds good.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:31.890
Mana...

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:33.080
Mana!

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.090
It's you and me!

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.200
It looks just like us!

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:44.720
Look, it's your old backpack!

00:09:44.720 --> 00:09:46.890
It looks great on me!

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:51.670
This pillow smells like you!

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:55.850
Regina...

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:57.260
<i>Precures...</i>

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.310
<i>I'll </i>never<i> forgive you!</i>

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:05.590
Mana, it's unhealthy if you don't eat.

00:10:06.230 --> 00:10:07.330
I don't wanna.

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:09.710
Keep it together!

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:12.520
You're a Precure, a legendary warrior!

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:15.490
Not anymore...

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:18.790
Kyupirappa!

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:20.640
Cha-what?

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:21.670
W-What?

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:26.790
What was that?

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:28.270
Yes?

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:30.980
It's getting busy out front,

00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:33.800
so could you look after Ai for a bit?

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:37.960
Huh?!

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:54.300
Ai, what are you doing here?

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:58.890
Well, where else would your baby sister be?

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:00.410
S-Sister?!

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:01.770
Thanks for the help.

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:04.680
Then that means...

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:07.410
I think that magic earlier...

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:10.860
made my parents think Ai was my sister.

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:12.590
Huuuuuh?!

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:13.770
Mana.

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:18.290
Ai, did you just call me "Mana?"

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:21.320
Ai! Mana!

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:23.000
Us!

00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:24.990
Ai...

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.040
A Nurture Lovies? {I don't think this term has come up before, despite these things being featured since the single digit episodes.}

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:31.740
You want me to use this?

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:41.110
Mana, happy, happy!

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:45.630
Are you trying to cheer me up?

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.590
Ai...

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:51.830
You were the one who nurtured me...

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.980
Thank you, Ai.

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:01.370
This is a pretty busy festival.

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:06.780
I'm sure Regina would love it here.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:29.400
Of course it wasn't her...

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:32.020
How long do you intend to mope around? {alt. "pining after your lost love"}

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:40.440
Wait, Ai!

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:49.290
If you don't change your attitude soon, you'll lose what you hold most dear,

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:50.750
Aida Mana.

00:12:53.940 --> 00:12:55.020
Can you sign this?

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:59.330
Sorry, but this is a private function, so autographs are...

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:01.530
Aw, come on!

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:04.950
Oh well.

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:06.840
It's enough to see Makopi in person.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.780
There's no need to hold back.

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:17.080
I shall grant your desire!

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:27.980
Go berserk!

00:13:27.980 --> 00:13:31.480
Release the darkness in your heart!

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.600
Selfish!

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:42.570
Sign this!

00:13:42.560 --> 00:13:44.270
If you'd please!

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.890
Everyone, please escape!

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:50.680
Girls, let's go!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:55.090
Precure Love Link!

00:13:55.470 --> 00:13:56.190
L-O-V-E!

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:56.870
L-O-V-E!

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:57.580
L-O-V-E!

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:58.680
L-O-V-E!

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:06.670
We'll have to make up for Mana while she can't transform!

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:07.460
Right!

00:14:07.460 --> 00:14:10.850
Oh my, aren't you lot on the scene quick?

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.170
Who are you?

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.880
I am Leva.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:15.250
And I'm Gula.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.670
Pleased to make your acquaintance!

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:22.270
Huh?

00:14:22.960 --> 00:14:25.710
Losing focus will get you eaten!

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:36.110
Sign these!

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:38.960
If you'd please!

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:45.970
Selfy selfy selfy!

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:50.040
Are you...

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:52.670
Mana, I heard a dark heartbeat!

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:55.500
The Sparkle Sword isn't working!

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.510
It's time to finish this.

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.930
Let's go to them, Charles.

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:18.380
But you can't transform!

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:19.640
We're going anyway.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:23.670
Thank you very much.

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:29.560
I couldn't stop thinking about how Regina was gone,

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:32.120
so I lost sight of what really mattered.

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:35.510
But it's not about what's most dear.

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:38.090
I just want to protect everyone's smiles.

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:42.300
That includes my friends', and Regina's, too.

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:45.190
I'll protect them all!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:54.340
Sign this!

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:55.860
If you'd please!

00:15:58.400 --> 00:16:01.920
An excellent silhouette - or perhaps a Curouette?

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:04.380
Self?

00:16:07.530 --> 00:16:08.820
You still fight?

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:12.580
Losing is not an option for us!

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:15.550
To make up for Mana, we have no choice...

00:16:16.230 --> 00:16:19.060
but to defend this town and the smiles of its people!

00:16:19.440 --> 00:16:21.310
What a nuisance.

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:22.530
Selfish!

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:24.400
Self!

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:28.410
Stop right there!

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:33.020
Mana!

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:34.420
You must stay back!

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:36.380
You can't transform!

00:16:36.380 --> 00:16:38.250
I won't run away anymore!

00:16:38.820 --> 00:16:42.220
I'll keep fighting to protect those I love!

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:44.050
Selfiiiiish!

00:16:47.380 --> 00:16:49.060
No cigar!

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:53.230
Watch it! {nani wo suru}

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:54.150
What was that for?! {nanja}

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:54.910
You hit me!

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:56.650
Nuh-uh, you did!

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:57.600
It worked!

00:16:57.600 --> 00:16:59.110
Good thinking! {Mana-chan sasuga desu}

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:00.510
Mana...

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:04.380
Excellent work, Aida Mana.

00:17:04.380 --> 00:17:06.210
No, Cure Heart!

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:10.220
The Precure's Five Vows!

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:10.750
First!

00:17:11.260 --> 00:17:15.450
A Precure must always hold her head high and persevere!

00:17:16.710 --> 00:17:18.240
Could she be...

00:17:19.060 --> 00:17:22.160
It seems you've recovered your love.

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:25.700
Now, let's fight together!

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:28.120
Yeah!

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:30.930
Charles!

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:34.730
Precure Love Link!

00:17:35.840 --> 00:17:36.540
L-O-V-E!

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:37.140
L-O-V-E!

00:17:37.130 --> 00:17:37.890
L-O-V-E!

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:38.880
L-O-V-E!

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.310
Brimming with love,

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:05.330
Cure Heart!

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:10.270
Oh poor pen and paper who have lost their love, {>signs}

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.430
I, Cure Heart,

00:18:12.430 --> 00:18:15.450
will make your hearts race once more!

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:20.380
Cure Heart!

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:23.640
End her by dying her in black!

00:18:23.640 --> 00:18:25.910
If you can, that is.

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:26.830
Self?

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.960
Ai, let's go!

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:33.460
Precure Dress Up!

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:36.410
Kyupirappa!

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:24.430
Love's trump card,

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:26.330
Cure Ace!

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:31.710
Beauty is the mark of the righteous!

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:34.250
With a single wink,

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:37.430
I shall pierce your heart!

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.840
Huh?!

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:42.130
Let's go.

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:43.140
Right!

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:48.560
Sign these!

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:54.750
If you'd please!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:55.790
Please!

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:08.320
Self?

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:13.330
Seeelf?

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:14.330
Self!

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:17.430
Seeelf!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:27.330
Are you ready?

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:28.140
You bet!

00:20:28.510 --> 00:20:29.570
Beautify!

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:31.800
Love Kiss Rouge!

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:42.320
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:44.010
Ace Shot!

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:45.370
Bang!

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:53.380
Love love loooove!

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:57.960
Precure Heart Shoot!

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:07.950
Love love loooove!

00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:13.090
Huh?

00:21:16.110 --> 00:21:17.680
Cure Ace...

00:21:17.680 --> 00:21:19.660
We'll show no mercy next time.

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:25.140
Cure Heart!

00:21:26.260 --> 00:21:27.860
Thank goodness!

00:21:27.860 --> 00:21:29.750
I'm so glad!

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.480
Sorry for making you worry.

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:37.220
Don't worry, as long as you're back to normal.

00:21:37.220 --> 00:21:39.010
Yes, indeed.

00:21:39.010 --> 00:21:41.320
You've no time for celebration.

00:21:42.410 --> 00:21:45.810
Your tribulations have only begun.

00:21:46.600 --> 00:21:50.020
You must continue to climb until you reach my stage.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.330
I shall be waiting.

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:53.530
Adieu.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:57.500
Cure Ace...

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:59.500
Who was that woman?

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:05.090
{ED}

00:22:07.140 --> 00:22:09.110
I'm going to quit being an idol.

00:22:09.110 --> 00:22:10.580
So I won't sing anymore.

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:13.010
What?! Makopi, you can't stop singing!

00:22:13.010 --> 00:22:15.650
Time for Operation "Make Her Want to Sing!"

00:22:15.650 --> 00:22:18.820
I shall prepare a splendid full orchestra!

00:22:18.820 --> 00:22:20.380
That'd make it kinda hard to sing...

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:23.350
If the princess asked her to sing, she wouldn't refuse!

00:22:23.350 --> 00:22:26.260
Huh? "Princess?" What are you planning?

00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:28.460
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.460 --> 00:22:31.600
Shocker!

00:22:28.460 --> 00:22:31.600
Shocker!

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:34.000
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
